{"active_object_question_id": "", "active_object_ref": {}, "answer_authority_source": "tutorbot_kb_first_fast_policy", "assistant_content_source": "", "capability": "tutorbot", "conversation_id": "unified_1780693823345_77c68200", "correct_answer_present": false, "entry_surface": "near_real_http_ws_wechat_payload", "event_count": 215, "event_source": "tutorbot", "execution_engine": "tutorbot_runtime", "execution_path": "tutorbot_kb_first_fast_policy", "is_correct": "", "learner_answer": "", "missing_trace_fields": [], "official_answer": "", "options_hash": "", "question_hash": "", "question_id": "", "question_lifecycle_decision": {"business_gate_result": "no_candidate", "decision_source": "none", "exact_question_blocked_reason": "", "llm_scene_candidate": null, "needs_clarification": false, "reason": "no deterministic scene and LLM proposal not applicable", "required_anchor_status": "", "scene": null, "scene_confidence": 0.0, "selected_skill_names": []}, "response_excerpt": "## 结论\n\n**三级配电**指总配电箱 → 分配电箱 → 开关箱（到用电设备）三级设置；**两级保护**指总配电箱和开关箱必须装设漏电保护器。\n\n## 判断依据\n\n- 三级配电：强制三级，中间不能越级配电，开关箱必须\"一机一闸一漏一箱\"。\n- 两级保护：第一级在总配电箱（总漏保），第二级在开关箱（末级漏保）；分配电箱不得装漏保，否则容易越级跳闸。\n\n## 采分点\n\n- 三级：总配 → 分配 → 开关箱\n- 两级：总配电箱漏保 + 开关箱漏保\n- 开关箱漏保是最后一道防线，动...", "result_mode": "tutorbot_kb_first_fast_policy", "result_seq": 213, "round_id": "QA30-STATE-002", "session_active_object_ref": {"object_id": "exam-query:2021案例二第3问答案发我，别废话", "object_type": "question_lifecycle_clarification", "source_turn_id": "", "version": 1}, "terminal_status": "completed", "trace_complete": true, "trace_expectation": "open_world_teaching", "turn_id": "turn_1780693844162_365a9a505e", "turn_semantic_decision": {}, "turn_status": "completed"}
{"active_object_question_id": "", "active_object_ref": {}, "answer_authority_source": "tutorbot_kb_first_fast_policy", "assistant_content_source": "", "capability": "tutorbot", "conversation_id": "unified_1780693823345_77c68200", "correct_answer_present": false, "entry_surface": "near_real_http_ws_wechat_payload", "event_count": 151, "event_source": "tutorbot", "execution_engine": "tutorbot_runtime", "execution_path": "tutorbot_kb_first_fast_policy", "is_correct": "", "learner_answer": "", "missing_trace_fields": [], "official_answer": "", "options_hash": "", "question_hash": "", "question_id": "", "question_lifecycle_decision": {"business_gate_result": "no_candidate", "decision_source": "none", "exact_question_blocked_reason": "", "llm_scene_candidate": null, "needs_clarification": false, "reason": "no deterministic scene and LLM proposal not applicable", "required_anchor_status": "", "scene": null, "scene_confidence": 0.0, "selected_skill_names": []}, "response_excerpt": "## 结论\n\n总配电箱漏保：动作电流≥30mA（一般选75～150mA），动作时间＞0.1s（延时型）；开关箱漏保：动作电流≤30mA，动作时间≤0.1s。\n\n## 采分点\n\n- 总配漏保：延时型，防越级跳闸\n- 开关箱漏保：末级保护，30mA/0.1s\n- 潮湿/水下环境：开关箱漏保动作电流≤15mA\n\n## 易错点\n\n- 总配和开关箱漏保参数不能混\n- 不是所有漏保都按30mA/0.1s配，总配要放大\n- 潮湿环境不降级是常见失分点", "result_mode": "tutorbot_kb_first_fast_policy", "result_seq": 149, "round_id": "QA30-STATE-003", "session_active_object_ref": {"object_id": "exam-query:2021案例二第3问答案发我，别废话", "object_type": "question_lifecycle_clarification", "source_turn_id": "", "version": 1}, "terminal_status": "completed", "trace_complete": true, "trace_expectation": "open_world_teaching", "turn_id": "turn_1780693869252_f9dd44b38d", "turn_semantic_decision": {}, "turn_status": "completed"}
